L1: Effects of Maltodextrin–Fructose Supplementation on Inflammatory Biomarkers and Lipidomic Profile Following Endurance Running: A Randomized Placebo-Controlled Cross-Over Trial
L2: Nutrients (2024)
L3: Stefano Righetti, Alessandro Medoro, Francesca Graziano, Luca Mondazzi, Serena Martegani, Francesco Chiappero, Elena Casiraghi, Paolo Petroni, Graziamaria Corbi, Riccardo Pina, Giovanni Scapagnini, Sergio Davinelli, Camillo Ricordi
